# Annotated bibliography and access limits

Dates below are original preprint dates unless a journal-year key is explicitly used. An abstract establishes what its authors claim, not that all hypotheses have been checked. No source is labeled fully read merely because it was found. Exact source priorities remain subject to theorem-level comparison.

